Source Code for my Résumé

Original template is from Awesome CV
https://github.com/posquit0/Awesome-CV

Build:

    brew install tectonic   # once
    make                    # builds resume.pdf
    make publish            # copies it to ../atyansh-website/public/resume.pdf

Tectonic downloads the LaTeX packages it needs on the first build and caches
them. The fonts (Roboto, Source Sans Pro, FontAwesome) are bundled in fonts/.
